"Controls","revokeSessionToken.button","errorNoSessions.title","errorNoSessions.desc","embeddedt, taumc and contributors","LGPL-3.0","Faster chunk rendering, based on Sodium for Minecraft 1.12. Draws the world with far fewer draw calls.","Entity Culling","Treasure Client, inspired by tr7zw","Built in","Skips drawing mobs, chests, signs and banners that are hidden behind solid blocks.","Enhanced Block Entities","FoundationGames","Draws chests, ender chests and beds as part of the world instead of one by one every frame. Chests switch back while their lid moves.",
"FoamFix","Treasure Client, inspired by asie","Less memory and a faster start: block states share one compact lookup instead of a table each, and identical model faces are stored once.","foamfix","Treasure Client, inspired by Speiger","Less memory: after textures load, frees the leftover pixel copies of every texture that never animates.","texfix","CensoredASM","Treasure Client, inspired by Rongmario","Less memory and faster lookups: one shared copy of each repeated name (blocks, items, textures, NBT tags), better block position hashing, and no forced memory cleanup when joining a world.",
"censoredasm","BetterFps","Treasure Client, inspired by Guichaguri","Faster sine and cosine math from a small table (the same numbers as OptiFine\'s Fast Math, so anticheats accept it), and hoppers with a solid block on top stop searching for dropped items.","Dynamic Resolution","Treasure Client","When frames get slow from drawing, like when your device heats up, the world is drawn at a slightly lower resolution so the graphics chip has less to do. It goes back up once things are smooth again. It never goes below 70% or below your own Render Resolution setting, and it ignores lag that comes from the server.",
"AI Improvements","Treasure Client, inspired by QueenOfMissiles","Mobs reuse their last head-turn angles while what they look at hasn\'t moved, skipping costly math. Mobs only run in singleplayer, so this speeds up singleplayer worlds.","aiimprove","Celeritas Extra","Sumire-Labs","Extra switches for animations, particles, sky, weather, item frames, armor stands, paintings, beacon beams, enchanting books, pistons and toasts. Set them with the gear in Treasure Settings.","Celeritas Leaf Culling","Karnatour (fork of Sodium Leaf Culling)",
"MIT","With fancy leaves, skips leaf faces hidden inside trees. Pick Hollow, Solid Aggressive or Solid in Treasure Settings.","Lithium","CaffeineMC","Faster collisions, chunk lookups and block entity lists, with the same results. Also speeds up singleplayer.","ImmediatelyFast","RaphiMC","Cheaper name labels and signs: no rebuilding each name and re-measuring each sign line every frame, and no sign text past 32 blocks.","Dynamic FPS","juliand665","Drops to 10 FPS while another window is focused, so the game doesn\'t heat up your device in the background.",
"Memory Saver","Stops the idle singleplayer engine while you\'re on a server and frees unused sounds after 2 minutes instead of 10.","VanillaFix","DimensionalDevelopment","Recovers from crashes instead of closing the game, and fixes Minecraft bugs (menus in portals, camera in grass, a memory leak).","ViaVersion support","Shows modern 1.13+ blocks, items and entities on servers that send them.","Bug fixes","Performance","Compatibility","Credits","Unavailable","§cDisabled","§aEnabled","tcset","§l","§lMods","§6Treasure Client",
